        "code": ".sh-ui-pagination {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: var(--text-sm);\n  color: var(--foreground);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__item {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  min-width: 2.25rem;\n  height: 2.25rem;\n  padding: 0 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: calc(var(--radius) - 2px);\n  border: var(--border-width) solid transparent;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--foreground);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition:\n    background-color var(--duration-fast),\n    border-color var(--duration-fast),\n    color var(--duration-fast);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link[data-size=\"sm\"] {\n  min-width: 2rem;\n  height: 2rem;\n  padding: 0 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link:hover {\n  background: var(--background-muted);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link:focus-visible {\n  outline: var(--border-width-strong) solid var(--ring);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link[data-active] {\n  background: var(--foreground);\n  color: var(--background);\n  font-weight: var(--weight-medium);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link[data-active]:hover {\n  background: var(--foreground);\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__link[aria-disabled=\"true\"],\n.sh-ui-pagination__link[data-disabled] {\n  pointer-events: none;\n  opacity: var(--opacity-disabled);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__nav {\n  padding: 0 0.625rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__ellipsis {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 2.25rem;\n  height: 2.25rem;\n  color: var(--foreground-muted);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-pagination__sr {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: -1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .sh-ui-pagination__link {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n}\n",
