        "code": "/* ───────────── Switch ───────────── */\n\n.sh-ui-switch {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: var(--background-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  padding: 0.125rem;\n  transition: background-color 150ms;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n}\n\n/* sizes */\n.sh-ui-switch--sm {\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1.125rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch--md {\n  width: 2.5rem;\n  height: 1.375rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch:hover:not([data-disabled]) {\n  background: var(--border-strong);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch:focus-visible {\n  outline: var(--border-width-strong) solid var(--ring);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch[data-checked] {\n  background: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch[data-checked]:hover:not([data-disabled]) {\n  background: var(--primary-hover);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch[data-disabled] {\n  opacity: var(--opacity-disabled);\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n/* ───────────── Thumb ───────────── */\n\n.sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  display: block;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: white;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  transition: transform 150ms ease-out;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch--sm .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  width: 0.875rem;\n  height: 0.875rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch--md .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  width: 1.125rem;\n  height: 1.125rem;\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch--sm[data-checked] .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  transform: translateX(0.875rem);\n}\n\n.sh-ui-switch--md[data-checked] .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  transform: translateX(1.125rem);\n}\n\n/* checked 상태에서 thumb 와 트랙(--primary)이 같은 색으로 보이지 않도록\n   --primary-foreground 로 전환 (다크모드: primary=near-white → thumb=dark). */\n.sh-ui-switch[data-checked] .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n  background: var(--primary-foreground);\n}\n\n/* reduced motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .sh-ui-switch,\n  .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Windows 고대비 모드: on/off 가 background-color 만으로 표시되므로 시스템 색에 덮이면 구별 불가. */\n@media (forced-colors: active) {\n  .sh-ui-switch {\n    border: 1px solid ButtonBorder;\n    background: ButtonFace;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch[data-checked] {\n    background: Highlight;\n    border-color: Highlight;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n    background: ButtonText;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch[data-checked] .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n    background: HighlightText;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch:focus-visible {\n    outline-color: Highlight;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch[data-disabled] {\n    border-color: GrayText;\n  }\n  .sh-ui-switch[data-disabled] .sh-ui-switch__thumb {\n    background: GrayText;\n  }\n}\n",
